data: {"id": "ddb917b451644c6d-thinking-parallel_evidence-1072", "run_id": "ddb917b451644c6d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我已根据已返回的工具结果，对 Pod `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c` 的状态和根因线索进行了初步评估。\n\n### 1. 身份与生命周期确认\n*   **Pod UID:** `20db72b2-f223-4295-8f2d-62edd54cf1cd`\n*   **命名空间:** `aiops-case-06`\n*   **节点:** `node2`\n*   **状态:** Pod 处于 `Running` 阶段，但容器状态为 `CrashLoopBackOff`。\n*   **重启计数:** 21 次（最近一次重启在 117 秒前）。\n\n### 2. 候选原因评估 (CrashLoopBackOff)\n\n**支持证据 (Crash 原因)：**\n*   **应用层异常退出:** 上一次崩溃前的关键日志显示 `\"runtime process exiting\"` 且 `allocated_mib: 0`，伴随着 HTTP 500 状态码 (`/work` 路径)。(来自 `kubectl_previous_logs_all_contain", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788441705540, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

